{"title":"공작 부인은 하고 싶어도 [19세 완전판]","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=fSdWV/hAFrSy3zDJ/ciGvgzM38tGr7TCFxkUj70&filename=th3","synopsis":"엘마노 공작과 결혼식을 올린 지 한 달이 넘어가는데도 라리엘라는 아직 초야를 치르지 못하고 있었다.매일 밤 잠옷 차림으로 그녀를 찾아와 짧은 입맞춤과 무미건조한 인사만 던져놓고,아주 곤하게 잠만 자다가 돌아가는 엘마노 공작의 문제는 도대체 무엇일까.여자일까, 고자일까, 그것도 아니면 남자일까.하고 싶어도 할 수 없는 공작 부인의 고민은 오늘도 하염없이 깊어만 가고 있었다.ⓒ 린자,메타툰(원작 : 콩켸팥켸) / 메타툰","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":254,"change":{"type":"up","amount":12}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":284,"change":{"type":"down","amount":30}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":293,"change":{"type":"down","amount":9}}],"weekly":[],"monthly":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":115,"change":{"type":"down","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":115,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":114,"change":{"type":"up","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":117,"change":{"type":"down","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":119,"change":{"type":"down","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":119,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":121,"change":{"type":"down","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":121,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":119,"change":{"type":"up","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":120,"change":{"type":"down","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":122,"change":{"type":"down","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":122,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":120,"change":{"type":"up","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":122,"change":{"type":"down","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":127,"change":{"type":"down","amount":5}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":129,"change":{"type":"down","amount":2}}]},"viewSeries":[],"metricsSeries":[{"date":"2026-10-07","v":7805225,"rc":23229,"rs":230154,"cc":4015},{"date":"2026-10-08","v":7806378,"rc":23229,"rs":230154,"cc":4015},{"date":"2026-10-09","v":78